    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced top-down action gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels in 4 different worlds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyber Siege - Kepler-186 Under Attack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the year 2347, and the four planets in the Kepler-186 system face a huge danger: the Voidborn. This hostile alien alliance wants to drain the planets' life force. The only hope against them are  advanced defense robots, called mechs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/75cb124aefe04d066da972092808f099.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 1: Veridia - Gray Planet:</strong> The Voidborn first appear in Veridia's underground. They take over a huge maze of tunnels filled with a strange, pale blue light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/335eae76564860e592285cd071a06350.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 2: Crystalia - Orange Planet:</strong> The fight on Crystalia gets much scarier. Deep inside its crystal caves live giant, glowing spiders \u2013 some real, some advanced robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/dbd59d562f65769ba034a1174324ab54.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 3: Xylos - Blue Planet:</strong> Xylos, is a strange planet with a blue sky and glowing plants. The Voidborn set up bases across its wide, alien lands \u2013 the Indigo Expanse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/200b4acba4a4822ad78884ee471450d2.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 4: Technos - Red Planet:</strong> The final battle takes place on Technos, inside the Voidborn's main base \u2013 the Core Nexus. This place is a strong, high-tech area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/bbfee37a8ed69ee730d49ee49f9c7142.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced top-down action gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels in 4 different worlds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyber Siege - Kepler-186 Under Attack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the year 2347, and the four planets in the Kepler-186 system face a huge danger: the Voidborn. This hostile alien alliance wants to drain the planets' life force. The only hope against them are  advanced defense robots, called mechs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/75cb124aefe04d066da972092808f099.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 1: Veridia - Gray Planet:</strong> The Voidborn first appear in Veridia's underground. They take over a huge maze of tunnels filled with a strange, pale blue light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/335eae76564860e592285cd071a06350.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 2: Crystalia - Orange Planet:</strong> The fight on Crystalia gets much scarier. Deep inside its crystal caves live giant, glowing spiders \u2013 some real, some advanced robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/dbd59d562f65769ba034a1174324ab54.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 3: Xylos - Blue Planet:</strong> Xylos, is a strange planet with a blue sky and glowing plants. The Voidborn set up bases across its wide, alien lands \u2013 the Indigo Expanse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/200b4acba4a4822ad78884ee471450d2.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 4: Technos - Red Planet:</strong> The final battle takes place on Technos, inside the Voidborn's main base \u2013 the Core Nexus. This place is a strong, high-tech area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/bbfee37a8ed69ee730d49ee49f9c7142.avif?t=1755281695\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p>",
